# 不随节点包发布的内容（gitignore 语法，comfy node publish 用）
_dev_tests/
.github/
_backups/
.vscode/
.idea/
node_modules/
release.ps1
*.tgz
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.corrupt-backup
*.orig
*.rej
*~
